---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Karl Kenny — who I am, how I work, and why the engagement is designed to end."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="mono-label">About</p>
      <h1>Karl Kenny</h1>

      <div class="prose bio">
        <p>At 16, I decided to be an engineer.</p>
        <p>At 29, I became a leader.</p>
        <p>At 45, I tried to be an Entrepreneur.</p>
        <p>
          At 50, I realized I'm an excellent Integrator, a really good
          partner, coach and mentor to entrepreneurs.
        </p>
        <p>I aspire to help Owners be Owners, not Operators.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-l);
  }

  .bio {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
</style>
